#Lua SEXPs

$Operator: get-s-foils-status
$Category: Status
$Subcategory: LUA-Condition
$Minimum Arguments: 1
$Maximum Arguments: 1
$Return Type: Number
$Description: This sexp returns the status of s-foils for a given ship. Returns -1 if the ship does not have s-foils, 0 if the s-foils are moving, 1 if the s-foils are closed, and 2 if the s-foils are open. Note, does not work in multiplayer.
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Ship(s) to get s-foil status of.
	+Type: Ship	

$Operator: open-s-foils
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Action
$Minimum Arguments: 1
;$Maximum Arguments: 1
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: This sexp checks to see if the specified ship has working s-foils, then opens them. Note, does not work in multiplayer. 
$Repeat
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Ship(s) to check/open.
	+Type: Ship
	
$Operator: close-s-foils
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Action
$Minimum Arguments: 1
;$Maximum Arguments: 1
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: This sexp checks to see if the specified ship has working s-foils, then closes them. Note, does not work in multiplayer.
$Repeat
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Ship(s) to check/close.
	+Type: Ship	

#End